<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!-- UMW_Melee. Both-in-one ability trait (D5): a passive mood plus an active Rallying Cry.
         • Passive: rides the situational thought UMW_StoriedWeapon (ThoughtDefs/StoriedWeapon.xml,
           worker-scanned via ThoughtWorker_StoriedWeapon) — nothing to declare here, the worker finds
           the trait on the wielder's primary weapon the same way ThoughtWorker_BloodStainedWeapon
           does (shared UniqueWeaponTraitUtility helper).
         • Active: abilityProps grants UMW_RallyingCry (AbilityDefs/RallyingCry.xml) —
           REQUIRES the weapon def's CompProperties_EquippableAbilityReloadable (added in the
           weapon-def comps rework, §2.2 of the spec) to have somewhere to attach to.
         • Art: ForcedArtExtension guarantees an art inscription regardless of quality — the
           recorded lineage is literal CompArt content, with a colony tale preferred when the trait
           is added to an in-world weapon (case table in Source/1.6/Traits/ForcedArtExtension.cs).
       MarketValue +100 offset: the capability rule (added capability = flat offset, CLAUDE.md) wins
       over the provenance/finish framing that might otherwise suggest a factor — anchored on
       EMPPulser's +80 (the nearest ability-trait comparable) and bumped above it for the mood passive
       riding alongside the ability.
       Tags "Ability" (Odyssey's ability-trait convention) — also makes Storied mutually exclusive with
       UMW_Piledriver (Blunt), so a weapon carries at most one active ability. Alone-able: a storied
       weapon is a complete identity on its own (UMW_Lightweight backstops generation regardless). -->
  <WeaponTraitDef>
    <defName>UMW_Storied</defName>
    <label>storied</label>
    <description>This weapon carries a recorded lineage of named bearers and remembered deeds. The wielder can raise it high in a rallying cry; allies who see it are steeled, and for a time wounds barely slow them. Such a moment can only be called upon once every few days.</description>
    <commonality>0.5</commonality>
    <weaponCategory>UMW_Melee</weaponCategory>
    <exclusionTags>
      <li>Ability</li>
    </exclusionTags>
    <statOffsets>
      <MarketValue>100</MarketValue> <!-- EMPPulser +80, bumped for the mood passive; capability rule wins over the provenance factor -->
    </statOffsets>
    <traitAdjectives>
      <li>storied</li>
      <li>fabled</li>
      <li>ancestral</li>
      <li>honored</li>
    </traitAdjectives>
    <abilityProps>
      <abilityDef>UMW_RallyingCry</abilityDef>
    </abilityProps>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="UniqueMeleeWeapons.ForcedArtExtension" />
    </modExtensions>
  </WeaponTraitDef>

</Defs>
